        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4. Draw a straight line through S4 and S6. Draw a straight line through S6 and S8. Draw a straight line through S8 and S10. Draw a straight line through S10 and S12. Draw a straight line through S12 and S2.",
