    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The line through S2 and S4 crosses the horizontal line at Q1, right of O. Draw a line through Q1 parallel to the line at 135° from OA. It crosses the line at 45° from OA at P1. Draw a vertical line through P1. It crosses the horizontal line at N4.",
